  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        432.2626647949219,
        35.631988525390625,
        472.8128967285156,
        46.080078125
      ],
      "text": "Reading\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.34977722167969,
        70.18421173095703,
        134.86167907714844,
        80.27204132080078
      ],
      "text": "Questions 33-37\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.9898567199707,
        96.09839630126953,
        459.86492919921875,
        107.26707458496094
      ],
      "text": "Do the following statements agree with the claims of the writer in Reading Passage 3?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989871978759766,
        122.37246704101562,
        255.14654541015625,
        132.820556640625
      ],
      "text": "In boxes 33-37 on your answer sheet, write\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        81.34170532226562,
        147.92672729492188,
        418.9024963378906,
        184.6495819091797
      ],
      "text": "YES\nif the statement agrees with the claims of the writer\nNO\nif the statement contradicts the claims of the writer\nNOT GIVEN\nif it is impossible to say what the writer thinks about this\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989933013916016,
        199.39511108398438,
        465.62005615234375,
        225.320068359375
      ],
      "text": "33\nMany people who ended up winning prestigious intellectual prizes only reached an\naverage standard when young.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.98991775512695,
        235.3870391845703,
        403.3773498535156,
        246.55567932128906
      ],
      "text": "34\nEinstein's failures as a young man were due to his lack of confidence.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989933013916016,
        256.982177734375,
        464.22357177734375,
        267.79052734375
      ],
      "text": "35\nIt is difficult to reach agreement on whether some children are actually born gifted.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989933013916016,
        278.5773010253906,
        338.2337951660156,
        289.7459411621094
      ],
      "text": "36\nEinstein was upset by the public’s view of his life’s work.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989933013916016,
        298.73272705078125,
        383.83929443359375,
        322.8577880859375
      ],
      "text": "37\nEinstein put his success down to the speed at which he dealt with\nscientific questions.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.34986114501953,
        345.88214111328125,
        134.86175537109375,
        355.969970703125
      ],
      "text": "Questions 38-40\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.34986114501953,
        373.5959167480469,
        230.67935180664062,
        383.32342529296875
      ],
      "text": "Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        45.70978927612305,
        400.58984375,
        338.4319152832031,
        411.3982238769531
      ],
      "text": "Write the correct letter in boxes 38-40 on your answer sheet.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.98996353149414,
        429.0234069824219,
        423.7146301269531,
        486.2613525390625
      ],
      "text": "38\nWhat does Eyre believe is needed for children to equal ‘gifted’ standards?\nA _\nstrict discipline from the teaching staff\nB\nassistance from their peers in the classroom\nC\nthe development of a spirit of inquiry towards their studies\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        69.10449981689453,
        488.7699890136719,
        378.7932434082031,
        499.21807861328125
      ],
      "text": "D__\nthe determination to surpass everyone else's achievements\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.989933013916016,
        510.00518798828125,
        268.7695617675781,
        519.0121459960938
      ],
      "text": "39\nWhat is the result of Ericsson’s research?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        68.38467407226562,
        529.80078125,
        426.8531188964844,
        579.8402709960938
      ],
      "text": "A\nVery gifted students do not need to work on improving memory skills.\nB\nBeing born with a special gift is not the key factor in becoming expert.\nC\nIncluding time for physical exercise is crucial in raising performance.\nD\n10,000 hours of relevant and demanding work will create a genius.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        44.62999725341797,
        589.1873779296875,
        471.82147216796875,
        600.3560180664062
      ],
      "text": "40\nInthe penultimate paragraph, it is stated the key to some deprived children’s success is\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        68.74459838867188,
        609.7027587890625,
        366.6134338378906,
        646.4256591796875
      ],
      "text": "A\naregular and nourishing diet at home.\nB _ the loving support of more than one parent.\nC\n acommunity which has well-funded facilities for learning.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        69.46443176269531,
        648.214111328125,
        409.8037109375,
        659.3827514648438
      ],
      "text": "D__\nthe guidance of someone who recognises the benefits of learning.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        380.7943420410156,
        671.6088256835938,
        473.2503356933594,
        683.8582763671875
      ],
      "text": ">|@ p.123}\n51\n"
    }
